# Cloudflare static-assets headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
# The page CSP is a <meta> tag per page with hashes of that page's inline
# scripts (scripts/postbuild.ts); a <meta> CSP can't set frame-ancestors, so
# that part lives here. Values follow skyscribe.app's own headers.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

# Fingerprinted build output: the file name changes with the content.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
